WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An inquiry becomes a starting point.
A website form captures the request and contact details.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Give the request useful context.
AI organises the inquiry and drafts qualifying questions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Keep your tools in the loop.
A structured lead record reaches the connected CRM.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A person makes the important call.
Your team reviews the proposed next step before approval.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Move the conversation forward.
The approved follow-up is queued. The team is notified.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Less busywork. More business.
Fewer manual handoffs. Your people keep control.
